  "description": "Change of use from doctors surgery to children's day nursery involving internal and external alterations, as well as alterations to doors and windows. Associated alterations to hard and soft landscaping, and provision of cycle, refuse, buggy and toy stores. Installation of 1no. Air Conditioning unit within associated timber enclosure. New access gates, restoration of boundary walls and installation of secondary privacy fencing.  Internal alterations including: New internal staircase to replace an existing staircase; Alterations to rear porch; Removal of modern stud wall; Creation of openings in walls; Changes to internal doors; Addition of a dumb waiter between ground floor kitchen and first floor level; Removal of storage cupboards; Removal of secondary internal door to front entrance; Installation of additional WCs (Listed Building Consent)"
